Hello World", "keywords": ["HandTracking", "ManufacturingSimulation", "IndustrialVR", "Training", "InteractiveDemo"], "long_description": "Hello World is a free VR experience designed to showcase the power of hand tracking and immersive interaction in industrial environments.\n\nStep into a manufacturing simulation where you can explore and interact with real-world machinery \u2014 all without controllers. From operating a scissor lift and forklift to inspecting a toolbox, robotic arm, and concrete pump, each interaction is designed to highlight the precision and intuitiveness of VR hand tracking.\n\nBegin your journey in a guided tutorial zone with helpful videos and a tablet that walks you through each interaction. Once you're ready, teleport to a fully equipped warehouse and explore freely. Whether you're new to VR or evaluating use cases for your business, \"Hello World\" offers a hands-on glimpse into the potential of immersive technology.\n\nPerfect for industrial clients, enterprise partners, and anyone curious about the future of training and simulation \u2014 this is more than a demo; it's an experience.", "short_description": "Step into a VR manufacturing space and experience the power of hand tracking! 'Hello World' is a free interactive demo featuring machines like forklifts, scissor lifts, and robotic arms. Learn, interact, and explore \u2014 no controllers are needed."}]}, "developer_name": "Render ARVR Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://renderarvr.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Shail Shah", "support_website_url": "https://renderarvr.com/contact-us/", "website_url": "https://renderarvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "1063584910766706"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "ge